d directly as PENDING&lt;br&gt;(or VERIFIED by email domain match).&lt;br&gt;Resubmission after NEEDS_MORE_INFORMATION&lt;br&gt;creates a NEW row (revision+1,&lt;br&gt;previousRequestId) in PENDING." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#FFFBE0;strokeColor=#8A7A2A;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#1B2A3A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="636" y="830" width="470" height="126" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>